{# Interlayer energy under the reaction-force branch.

   `compute pair <substyle>` isolates the interlayer term only where it has a
   pair sub-style of its own (ilp/tmd, ilp/graphene/hbn,
   kolmogorov/crespi/full); the builder passes None otherwise and the energy
   is dropped, as for rebomos. Unlike the group/group scalar `v_e_int_il`
   (the shearing interface only) this is the sum over EVERY layer pair, so it
   gets its own name, `v_e_int_il_all` (observable E_int_interlayer_all), and
   is never mistaken for it. eV, unscaled. #}
{% macro emit_interlayer_energy(substyle) %}
{% if substyle %}
# Interlayer energy from the interlayer pair sub-style alone (every layer pair).
compute         e_il all pair {{ substyle }}
variable        e_int_il_all equal c_e_il
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
